message.content:
{"diagnosis": "Fetch test shows max_addr stuck at 0x00000000 with TRAP: no progress, expected PC to advance through 256 NOP words. mem_state never leaves 0 for instruction fetch so mem_valid never asserts. Root cause in excerpt line 583 is `if (mem_do_prefetch && mem_do_rinst || mem_do_rdata)` using && instead of ||, requiring prefetch and rinst together and blocking normal fetch.", "patch_diff": "diff --git a/picorv32.v b/picorv32.v
--- a/picorv32.v
+++ b/picorv32.v
@@ -582,4 +582,4 @@
 				0: begin
-					if (mem_do_prefetch && mem_do_rinst || mem_do_rdata) begin
+					if (mem_do_prefetch || mem_do_rinst || mem_do_rdata) begin
 						mem_valid <= !mem_la_use_prefetched_high_word;
 						mem_instr <= mem_do_prefetch || mem_do_rinst;
", "expected": "tohost PASS, no TRAP: no progress, max_addr advances beyond 0x00000000"}

